<title>USA: Baldwin Piano names Schwartz finance head.</title>
<headline>Baldwin Piano names Schwartz finance head.</headline>
<dateline>LOVELAND, Ohio 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baldwin Piano &amp; Organ Co said Perry Schwartz has been named executive vice president and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Previously, Schwartz was vice president - chief financial officer of Richwood Pharmaceutical, a manufacturer and distributor of ethical drugs.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
